1:["$","$Ld",null,{"active":"05-self-supervised","title":"模型原理 · 第 5 讲 · 自监督学习","children":["$","$Le","05-self-supervised",{"lesson":{"slug":"05-self-supervised","number":5,"title":"自监督学习","english":"Self-supervised Learning","shortTitle":"自监督学习","topics":["动机与评价","传统代理任务与 MAE","现代自监督学习"],"topicAnchors":["topic-1","topic-21","topic-75"],"pages":112,"hidden":0,"summary":"围绕监督信号从何而来，依次学习代理任务、掩码重建、对比学习、自蒸馏及其评估方法。"},"content":{"file":"5.Self-supervised Learning.pptx","slides":[{"page":1,"part":"ppt/slides/slide1.xml","text":["Self-supervised Learning","(2026)","Lecturer: Xue Yang","yangxue.site"],"pictures":4,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":1,"kind":"roadmap","title":"自监督学习","caption":"从预训练信号到可迁移的表示","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/1.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":2,"part":"ppt/slides/slide2.xml","text":["Contents","Introduction","Traditional SSL","Modern SSL"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":2,"kind":"roadmap","title":"自监督学习","caption":"从预训练信号到可迁移的表示","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/2.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":3,"part":"ppt/slides/slide3.xml","text":["Introduction","ImageNet Story","ImageNet is the large-scale benchmark for image classification","training: 1k categories, 1k images per category","testing: 100k images ","ILSVRC"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":3,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/3.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":4,"part":"ppt/slides/slide4.xml","text":["Introduction","Lots of Computer Vision Tasks","Classification","    Semantic","Segmentation","     Object","   Detection","     Instance","Segmentation","CAT","GRASS, CAT, TREE, SKY","DOG, DOG, CAT","DOG, DOG, CAT"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":4,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/4.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":5,"part":"ppt/slides/slide5.xml","text":["Introduction","To some extent, any visual task can now be solved ","Collect a large-scale dataset labelled for the task of interest","Specify a training objective and neural network architecture","Train the model and deploy","Good and sufficient data is all you need","The key question is: how can we train a high-performance model with limited data? "],"pictures":0,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":5,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/5.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":6,"part":"ppt/slides/slide6.xml","text":["Introduction","Transfer Learning","Train from Scratch","Given a dataset with large number of manual annotations:","Transfer Learning","Given a dataset with small number of manual annotations (k << n):"],"pictures":6,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":6,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/6.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":7,"part":"ppt/slides/slide7.xml","text":["Introduction","Transfer Learning","Improvements in CNN architectures lead to improvements in many downstream tasks thanks to transfer learning!"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":7,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/7.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":8,"part":"ppt/slides/slide8.xml","text":["Introduction","Learned Representations","What is the problem with large-scale training?","We need a lot of labeled data","Is there a way we can train neural networks without the need for huge manually labeled datasets?","Class Labels"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":8,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/8.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":9,"part":"ppt/slides/slide9.xml","text":["Introduction","Here, we find it","I always knew unsupervised learning was the right thing to do.","                                                                         ---Geoffrey E. Hinton","Basically it's the idea of learning to represent the world before learning a task, and this is what babies do.","                                                                               --- Yann LeCun","And so if we can build models of the world where we have the right abstractions, where we can pin down those changes to just one or a few variables, then we will be able to adapt to those changes because we don't need as much data, as much observation in order to figure out what has changed.","                                                                            --- Yoshua Bengio"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":9,"kind":"multi-task","title":"同一表示连接不同视觉任务","caption":"预训练学习表示，下游任务检验它是否有用","note":"分类、检测与分割的输出形式不同，但可以复用特征提取器。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/9.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":10,"part":"ppt/slides/slide10.xml","text":["Introduction","Why self-supervised learning (SSL)","Human infants adopt very different ways for learning:","mainly from observation and manipulation","only require few explicit supervision","learn from multimodal data, e.g. vision, sound, touch, etc.","learn progressively, e.g. curriculum learning"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":10,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/10.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":11,"part":"ppt/slides/slide11.xml","text":["Introduction","Why self-supervised learning (SSL)","Self-supervised learning is an alternative for learning representation:","save cost for manual annotations","more scalable training, e.g. billions of images are generated everyday","more robust visual representation learning "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":11,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/11.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":12,"part":"ppt/slides/slide12.xml","text":["Introduction","Why self-supervised learning (SSL)","A form of unsupervised learning where the data itself provides the supervision.","With hold some part of the data, and task the network with predicting it, termed as pretext task.","While solving the pretext task, the network is forced to learn what we really care about, e.g. a semantic representation."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":12,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/12.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":13,"part":"ppt/slides/slide13.xml","text":["Introduction","What is self-supervised learning (SSL)","Pretext Task","Define a task based on the data itself","No manual annotation","Could be considered an unsupervised task, but we learn with supervised learning objectives, e.g., classification or regression. ","Downstream Task","The application you care about","You do not have large datasets","The dataset is labeled "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":13,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/13.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":14,"part":"ppt/slides/slide14.xml","text":["Introduction","Pretext Task","Dataset (no labels)","Decoder,","Classifier,","Regressor","Encoder ","Learned Representation ","Labels/outputs","automatically","generated","from data"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":14,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/14.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":15,"part":"ppt/slides/slide15.xml","text":["Introduction","Downstream Task","Decoder,","Classifier,","Regressor","Encoder ","Learned Representation ","Labels/outputs","automatically","generated","from data","FC","labels","Dataset (with labels)"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":15,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/15.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":16,"part":"ppt/slides/slide16.xml","text":["Introduction","Pretext Tasks","Example: learn to predict image transformations / complete corrupted images ","Solving the pretext tasks allow the model to learn good features.","We can automatically generate labels for the pretext tasks. ","image completion                rotation prediction                “jigsaw puzzle”                      colorization "],"pictures":4,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":16,"kind":"self-supervision","title":"从输入本身构造训练目标","caption":"变换、遮挡和多视图关系都能形成监督信号","note":"代理任务完成得好，并不自动保证下游表示有效。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/16.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":17,"part":"ppt/slides/slide17.xml","text":["Introduction","How to evaluate a self-supervised learning method?","There are generally two paradigms for evaluating the representation:","Evaluate on ImageNet with linear probing, i.e. freeze the feature encoder, and only train the classifier with labels","Evaluate on downstream tasks without fine-tuning, e.g. zero-shot transfer "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":17,"kind":"evaluation","title":"冻结表示，还是允许适配","caption":"线性评估与微调回答不同的问题","note":"比较模型时应尽量统一主干、数据与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/17.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":18,"part":"ppt/slides/slide18.xml","text":["Introduction","How to evaluate a self-supervised learning method?","lots of ","unlabeled ","data","self-supervised","learning","feature","extractor","supervised","learning","evaluate on the","target task","e.g. classification, detection","90°","conv","fc","small amount of","labeled data on","the target task","bird","conv","linear","classifier","1. Learn good feature extractors from","self-supervised pretext tasks, e.g.,","predicting image rotations","2. Attach a shallow network on the","feature extractor; train the shallow","network on the target task with small","amount of labeled data"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":18,"kind":"evaluation","title":"冻结表示，还是允许适配","caption":"线性评估与微调回答不同的问题","note":"比较模型时应尽量统一主干、数据与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/18.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":19,"part":"ppt/slides/slide19.xml","text":["Introduction","How to evaluate a self-supervised learning method?","lots of ","unlabeled ","data","self-supervised","learning","feature","extractor","supervised","learning","evaluate on the","target task","e.g. classification, detection","90°","conv","fc","small amount of","labeled data on","the target task","bird","conv","linear","classifier","1. Learn good feature extractors from","self-supervised pretext tasks, e.g.,","predicting image rotations","2. Attach a shallow network on the","feature extractor; train the shallow","network on the target task with small","amount of labeled data"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":19,"kind":"evaluation","title":"冻结表示，还是允许适配","caption":"线性评估与微调回答不同的问题","note":"比较模型时应尽量统一主干、数据与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/19.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":20,"part":"ppt/slides/slide20.xml","text":["Introduction","Broader picture","Today’s lecture","computer vision","language modeling","speech synthesis","robot / reinforcement learning","Doersch et al., 2015","Dense Object Net (Florence","and Manuelli et al., 2018)","GPT-4 (OpenAI 2023)","Wavenet (van den Oord et al.,","2016)"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":20,"kind":"evaluation","title":"冻结表示，还是允许适配","caption":"线性评估与微调回答不同的问题","note":"比较模型时应尽量统一主干、数据与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/20.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":21,"part":"ppt/slides/slide21.xml","text":["Contents","Introduction","Traditional SSL","         Rotation, Inpainting, Rearrangement, Coloring","         Reconstruction-based learning: MAE","Modern SSL"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":21,"kind":"roadmap","title":"传统代理任务","caption":"通过空间结构、颜色与缺失信息构造目标","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/21.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":22,"part":"ppt/slides/slide22.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict relative patch locations"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":22,"kind":"relative-patch","title":"预测图像块的相对位置","caption":"以中心图块为参照，判断邻近图块来自哪里","note":"模型需要利用局部内容与空间关系；应防止只学习边界捷径。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/22.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":23,"part":"ppt/slides/slide23.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict relative patch locations","Randomly sample patches, and task the network to predict their relative position.","If the model solves this task, it may have learnt useful representation on object structure. "],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":23,"kind":"relative-patch","title":"预测图像块的相对位置","caption":"以中心图块为参照，判断邻近图块来自哪里","note":"模型需要利用局部内容与空间关系；应防止只学习边界捷径。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/23.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":24,"part":"ppt/slides/slide24.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","What does pretext task learn?     ---Nearest Neighbors","Input","Random Initialization","ImageNet AlexNet ","Method in Paper"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":24,"kind":"evidence","title":"由代理任务检查表示质量","caption":"近邻检索与下游检测提供不同观察角度","note":"近邻检索观察表示的相似性，下游任务检验表示是否有用。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/24.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image34.png","lesson":5,"page":24}]}},{"page":25,"part":"ppt/slides/slide25.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","What does pretext task learn?     ---Object Detection"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":25,"kind":"evidence","title":"由代理任务检查表示质量","caption":"近邻检索与下游检测提供不同观察角度","note":"近邻检索观察表示的相似性，下游任务检验表示是否有用。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/25.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image35.png","lesson":5,"page":25}]}},{"page":26,"part":"ppt/slides/slide26.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: solving “jigsaw puzzles”"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":26,"kind":"jigsaw","title":"把拼图顺序作为学习目标","caption":"打乱图块，让模型辨认空间排列","note":"拼图既涉及局部纹理，也涉及物体的整体布局。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/26.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":27,"part":"ppt/slides/slide27.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: solving “jigsaw puzzles”","Randomly shuffle the image patches.","Train a network to recover the image, e.g. their relative positions.","Scale the pairwise relation to multi-patch permutations. "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":27,"kind":"jigsaw","title":"把拼图顺序作为学习目标","caption":"打乱图块，让模型辨认空间排列","note":"拼图既涉及局部纹理，也涉及物体的整体布局。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/27.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":28,"part":"ppt/slides/slide28.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: solving “jigsaw puzzles”"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":28,"kind":"jigsaw","title":"把拼图顺序作为学习目标","caption":"打乱图块，让模型辨认空间排列","note":"拼图既涉及局部纹理，也涉及物体的整体布局。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/28.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":29,"part":"ppt/slides/slide29.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: solving “jigsaw puzzles”","“Ours” is feature learned from solving image Jigsaw","Doersch et al. is the method with relative patch location"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":29,"kind":"jigsaw","title":"把拼图顺序作为学习目标","caption":"打乱图块，让模型辨认空间排列","note":"拼图既涉及局部纹理，也涉及物体的整体布局。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/29.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":30,"part":"ppt/slides/slide30.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict rotations"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":30,"kind":"rotation","title":"用已知旋转生成训练标签","caption":"同一输入对应 0°、90°、180° 与 270° 四种变换","note":"变换类别由构造过程自动提供，无需人工标注物体类别。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/30.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":31,"part":"ppt/slides/slide31.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict rotations","Hypothesis (rotation invariance): a model could recognize the correct rotation of an object only if it has the “visual commonsense” of what the object should look like unperturbed."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":31,"kind":"rotation","title":"用已知旋转生成训练标签","caption":"同一输入对应 0°、90°、180° 与 270° 四种变换","note":"变换类别由构造过程自动提供，无需人工标注物体类别。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/31.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":32,"part":"ppt/slides/slide32.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict rotations","Self-supervised learning by rotating","the entire input images.","The model learns to predict which rotation is applied (4-way classification)"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":32,"kind":"rotation","title":"用已知旋转生成训练标签","caption":"同一输入对应 0°、90°、180° 与 270° 四种变换","note":"变换类别由构造过程自动提供，无需人工标注物体类别。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/32.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":33,"part":"ppt/slides/slide33.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict rotations","Self-supervised learning by rotating","the entire input images.","The model learns to predict which rotation is applied (4-way classification)"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":33,"kind":"evidence","title":"旋转任务学到了什么","caption":"结合预训练设置和下游结果检验表示","note":"把可视化结果与下游评价结合起来判断表示质量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/33.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image42.png","lesson":5,"page":33}]}},{"page":34,"part":"ppt/slides/slide34.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict rotations","Self-supervised learning on","CIFAR10 (entire training set).","Freeze conv1 + conv2","Learn conv3 + linear layers with","subset of labeled CIFAR10 data","(classification)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":34,"kind":"evidence","title":"旋转任务学到了什么","caption":"结合预训练设置和下游结果检验表示","note":"把可视化结果与下游评价结合起来判断表示质量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/34.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image43.png","lesson":5,"page":34}]}},{"page":35,"part":"ppt/slides/slide35.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict rotations","Self-supervised learning on","ImageNet (entire training set)","Finetune on labeled data","from Pascal VOC 2007.","Self-supervised learning with rotation prediction","Pretrained with full ImageNet supervision","No pretraining"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":35,"kind":"evidence","title":"旋转任务学到了什么","caption":"结合预训练设置和下游结果检验表示","note":"把可视化结果与下游评价结合起来判断表示质量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/35.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image44.png","lesson":5,"page":35}]}},{"page":36,"part":"ppt/slides/slide36.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":36,"kind":"colorization","title":"从亮度信息预测颜色","caption":"颜色目标来自原图自身","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/36.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image47.png","lesson":5,"page":38,"crop":[0.005,0.018,0.432,0.623]},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image48.png","lesson":5,"page":39,"crop":[0.56,0.016,0.431,0.6]}]}},{"page":37,"part":"ppt/slides/slide37.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","Feed grayscale images as input, and task the model to colorize it.","Intuitively, if the network can colorize the image, it has to understand what the objects look like, e.g. the object patterns."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":37,"kind":"colorization","title":"从亮度信息预测颜色","caption":"颜色目标来自原图自身","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/37.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image47.png","lesson":5,"page":38,"crop":[0.005,0.018,0.432,0.623]},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image47.png","lesson":5,"page":38,"crop":[0.562,0.018,0.431,0.623]}]}},{"page":38,"part":"ppt/slides/slide38.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","Lab Color Space:"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":38,"kind":"colorization","title":"从亮度信息预测颜色","caption":"颜色目标来自原图自身","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/38.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image47.png","lesson":5,"page":38,"crop":[0.005,0.018,0.432,0.623]},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image47.png","lesson":5,"page":38,"crop":[0.562,0.018,0.431,0.623]}]}},{"page":39,"part":"ppt/slides/slide39.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","Lab Color Space:"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":39,"kind":"colorization","title":"从亮度信息预测颜色","caption":"颜色目标来自原图自身","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/39.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image48.png","lesson":5,"page":39,"crop":[0.005,0.016,0.432,0.6]},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image48.png","lesson":5,"page":39,"crop":[0.56,0.016,0.431,0.6]}]}},{"page":40,"part":"ppt/slides/slide40.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","ECCV 2016","CVPR 2017"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":40,"kind":"split-brain","title":"跨通道预测：Split-Brain Autoencoders","caption":"将输入分为两个通道子集，互相预测缺失部分","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/40.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":41,"part":"ppt/slides/slide41.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","Learning features from colorization: Split-brain Autoencoder","(a) Lab Images","(b) RGB-D Images"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":41,"kind":"split-brain","title":"两个方向同时学习跨通道关系","caption":"一支由 X₁ 预测 X₂，另一支由 X₂ 预测 X₁","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/41.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":42,"part":"ppt/slides/slide42.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","Split-brain Autoencoder Idea: cross-channel predictions"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":42,"kind":"split-brain","title":"自编码与跨通道预测的区别","caption":"避免简单复制输入；通过缺失通道构造目标","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/42.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":43,"part":"ppt/slides/slide43.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring","Transfer learned features to supervised learning","Supervised","Split-brain ","Autoencoder ","Self-supervised learning on","ImageNet (entire training set).","Use concatenated features","from F1 and F2","Labeled data is from the","Places (Zhou 2016)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":43,"kind":"evidence","title":"从亮度信息预测颜色","caption":"颜色目标来自原图自身","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/43.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image53.png","lesson":5,"page":43}]}},{"page":44,"part":"ppt/slides/slide44.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: image coloring"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":44,"kind":"colorization","title":"从亮度信息预测颜色","caption":"颜色目标来自原图自身","note":"同一灰度输入可能对应多种合理颜色。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/44.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image54.png","lesson":5,"page":44}]}},{"page":45,"part":"ppt/slides/slide45.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","Idea: model the temporal coherence of colors in videos","reference frame","how should I color these frames?"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":45,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/45.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image55.png","lesson":5,"page":45}]}},{"page":46,"part":"ppt/slides/slide46.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","Hypothesis: learning to color video frames should allow model to learn to track regions or objects without labels!","reference frame","how should I color these frames?","Should be the same color!"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":46,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/46.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image55.png","lesson":5,"page":46}]}},{"page":47,"part":"ppt/slides/slide47.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","Learning objective:","Establish mappings between reference and target frames in a learned feature space.","Use the mapping as “pointers” to copy the correct color (LAB)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":47,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/47.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image55.png","lesson":5,"page":45}]}},{"page":48,"part":"ppt/slides/slide48.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","attention map on the reference frame"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":48,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/48.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":49,"part":"ppt/slides/slide49.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","attention map on the reference frame","predicted color = weighted","sum of the reference color"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":49,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/49.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":50,"part":"ppt/slides/slide50.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","attention map on the reference frame","predicted color = weighted","sum of the reference color","loss between predicted color","and ground truth color"],"pictures":4,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":50,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/50.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":51,"part":"ppt/slides/slide51.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","reference frame","target frames (gray) ","predicted color"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":51,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/51.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image61.png","lesson":5,"page":51}]}},{"page":52,"part":"ppt/slides/slide52.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","reference frame","target frames (gray) ","predicted color"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":52,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/52.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image62.png","lesson":5,"page":52}]}},{"page":53,"part":"ppt/slides/slide53.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","Tracking emerges from colorization","Propagate segmentation masks using learned attention"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":53,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/53.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image63.png","lesson":5,"page":53},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image64.png","lesson":5,"page":53},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image65.png","lesson":5,"page":53}]}},{"page":54,"part":"ppt/slides/slide54.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: video coloring","Tracking emerges from colorization","Propagate pose keypoints using learned attention"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":54,"kind":"video-color","title":"借助跨帧对应传递颜色","caption":"时间关系为表示学习提供另一种监督信号","note":"跨帧对应让模型把参考帧中的颜色传递到目标帧。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/54.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image68.png","lesson":5,"page":54},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image67.png","lesson":5,"page":54},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image66.png","lesson":5,"page":54}]}},{"page":55,"part":"ppt/slides/slide55.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict missing pixels (inpainting)"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":55,"kind":"inpainting","title":"从可见上下文重建缺失内容","caption":"遮挡输入，使用原图中的被遮挡部分作为目标","note":"像素重建的质量与下游语义表示的质量需要分开评价。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/55.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image72.png","lesson":5,"page":58},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image74.png","lesson":5,"page":58},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image73.png","lesson":5,"page":58},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image75.png","lesson":5,"page":58}]}},{"page":56,"part":"ppt/slides/slide56.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict missing pixels (inpainting)","Randomly mask some regions from the image.","Train a network to recover the missing regions."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":56,"kind":"inpainting","title":"从可见上下文重建缺失内容","caption":"遮挡输入，使用原图中的被遮挡部分作为目标","note":"像素重建的质量与下游语义表示的质量需要分开评价。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/56.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":57,"part":"ppt/slides/slide57.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict missing pixels (inpainting)","Loss = reconstruction + adversarial learning","Adversarial loss between “real” images and inpainted images"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":57,"kind":"inpainting-loss","title":"重建损失与对抗损失","caption":"既比较缺失区域的内容，也约束输出的真实性","note":"像素重建的质量与下游语义表示的质量需要分开评价。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/57.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":58,"part":"ppt/slides/slide58.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict missing pixels (inpainting)","Input (context)","reconstruction","adversarial","recon + adv"],"pictures":4,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":58,"kind":"reconstruction","title":"图像修复的输入与输出","caption":"比较遮挡输入、修复结果与目标图像","note":"像素重建的质量与下游语义表示的质量需要分开评价。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/58.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image72.png","lesson":5,"page":58},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image74.png","lesson":5,"page":58},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image73.png","lesson":5,"page":58},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image75.png","lesson":5,"page":58}]}},{"page":59,"part":"ppt/slides/slide59.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Pretext task: predict missing pixels (inpainting)","Self-supervised learning on ImageNet training set, transfer to classification (Pascal VOC 2007), detection (Pascal VOC 2007), and semantic segmentation (Pascal VOC 2012)"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":59,"kind":"evidence","title":"图像修复预训练的下游效果","caption":"遮挡输入，使用原图中的被遮挡部分作为目标","note":"像素重建的质量与下游语义表示的质量需要分开评价。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/59.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image76.png","lesson":5,"page":59}]}},{"page":60,"part":"ppt/slides/slide60.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","MAE: Masked Autoencoders Are Scalable Vision Learners"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":60,"kind":"mae","title":"MAE 的非对称编码与解码","caption":"编码器只读取可见 patch，解码器重建被遮挡区域","note":"高遮挡比例减少重型编码器处理的 token 数量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/60.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":61,"part":"ppt/slides/slide61.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Reconstruction with a larger masked portion","masked","reconstruction","reconstruction+visible","original","50% masking ratio","75% masking ratio","masked","reconstruction","reconstruction+visible","original"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":61,"kind":"mae","title":"MAE 的非对称编码与解码","caption":"编码器只读取可见 patch，解码器重建被遮挡区域","note":"高遮挡比例减少重型编码器处理的 token 数量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/61.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":62,"part":"ppt/slides/slide62.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","How does MAE work? ","Masking Methods:","Similar to the original ViT, divide the input into non-overlapping patches.","Uniformly sample a very large proportion (75%) of these patches and mask them.","Masking a high ratio makes predicting the task challenging and meaningful."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":62,"kind":"mae","title":"MAE 的非对称编码与解码","caption":"编码器只读取可见 patch，解码器重建被遮挡区域","note":"高遮挡比例减少重型编码器处理的 token 数量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/62.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":63,"part":"ppt/slides/slide63.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","How does MAE work? ","MAE Encoder","The encoder only operates on unmasked patches (25%)","Uses transformer blocks, Embeds the patches by linear projection and add positional embeddings","Since the input patches are a small part of the input, the encoder is chosen to be very large.  (encoder has over 9 times computations per token vs decoder) "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":63,"kind":"mae","title":"MAE 的非对称编码与解码","caption":"编码器只读取可见 patch，解码器重建被遮挡区域","note":"高遮挡比例减少重型编码器处理的 token 数量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/63.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":64,"part":"ppt/slides/slide64.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","How does MAE work? ","MAE Decoder","Merges the encoder outputs with the shared mask tokens in previously masked places, adding positional encodings.","Uses transformer blocks, followed by a linear projection for finalizing pixel reconstruction.","Is solely responsible for reconstruction, meaning it is not used posttraining. Hence, it is independent of the encoder design, making it flexible. This is an asymmetrical autoencoder design."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":64,"kind":"mae","title":"MAE 的非对称编码与解码","caption":"编码器只读取可见 patch，解码器重建被遮挡区域","note":"高遮挡比例减少重型编码器处理的 token 数量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/64.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":65,"part":"ppt/slides/slide65.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","How does MAE work? ","Reconstruction","The MSE (mean squared error loss) in the pixel space between the input image and the reconstructed image is adopted.","Loss is only computed for masked patches"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":65,"kind":"mae","title":"MAE 的非对称编码与解码","caption":"编码器只读取可见 patch，解码器重建被遮挡区域","note":"高遮挡比例减少重型编码器处理的 token 数量。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/65.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":66,"part":"ppt/slides/slide66.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Linear Probing vs Full Fine-tuning","In linear probing, the pre-trained model is fixed, and only one linear layer is added at the end, to predict the labels (or produce the output). This method is used to assess the quality of representations from a pre-trained feature extraction model. ","In fine-tuning, pre-trained model is further trained (not fixed), and one or more layers, possibly with non-linearities are added. "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":66,"kind":"evaluation","title":"线性评估与全量微调","caption":"冻结主干检验固定表示，微调检验适配后的能力","note":"不同评价协议的数字不能不加区分地直接比较。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/66.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":67,"part":"ppt/slides/slide67.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Linear Probing vs Full Fine-tuning","Linear probing: provides a measure of representation quality of a pre-training in restricted conditions","Fine-tuning: exploits models near-true potential to adopt for new tasks "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":67,"kind":"evaluation","title":"线性评估与全量微调","caption":"冻结主干检验固定表示，微调检验适配后的能力","note":"不同评价协议的数字不能不加区分地直接比较。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/67.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":68,"part":"ppt/slides/slide68.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Ablation Studies","So many modeling/hyperparameter choices:","Masking ratio","Decoder depth","Decoder width","Mask token (used or not in encoder)","Reconstruction target","Data augmentation","Mask sampling method","Training schedule","mask sampling strategies"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":68,"kind":"evidence","title":"通过消融比较 MAE 的设计选择","caption":"遮挡比例、解码器、重建目标与训练设置共同影响结果","note":"固定评价协议后，比较遮挡比例、解码器和训练设置的影响。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/68.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image81.png","lesson":5,"page":68},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image83.png","lesson":5,"page":68},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image82.png","lesson":5,"page":68}]}},{"page":69,"part":"ppt/slides/slide69.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Comparisons","Decoder depth","Decoder width"],"pictures":4,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":69,"kind":"reconstruction","title":"MAE 的重建样本","caption":"对照输入、遮挡与预测，观察可见上下文的作用","note":"固定评价协议后，比较遮挡比例、解码器和训练设置的影响。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/69.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image84.png","lesson":5,"page":69},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image85.png","lesson":5,"page":69},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image86.png","lesson":5,"page":69},{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image87.png","lesson":5,"page":69}]}},{"page":70,"part":"ppt/slides/slide70.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","MAE visualizations "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":70,"kind":"reconstruction","title":"观察重建结果利用了什么上下文","caption":"把输入、遮挡与模型输出对应起来","note":"比较输入、遮挡与模型输出，观察可见上下文能支持哪些重建。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/70.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image88.png","lesson":5,"page":70}]}},{"page":71,"part":"ppt/slides/slide71.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","MAE visualizations "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":71,"kind":"reconstruction","title":"观察重建结果利用了什么上下文","caption":"把输入、遮挡与模型输出对应起来","note":"比较输入、遮挡与模型输出，观察可见上下文能支持哪些重建。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/71.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image89.png","lesson":5,"page":71}]}},{"page":72,"part":"ppt/slides/slide72.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","MAE visualizations "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":72,"kind":"reconstruction","title":"观察重建结果利用了什么上下文","caption":"把输入、遮挡与模型输出对应起来","note":"比较输入、遮挡与模型输出，观察可见上下文能支持哪些重建。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/72.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image90.png","lesson":5,"page":72}]}},{"page":73,"part":"ppt/slides/slide73.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Summary","Pretext tasks focus on “visual common sense”, e.g., predict rotations, inpainting, rearrangement, and colorization.","The models are forced learn good features about natural images, e.g., semantic representation of an object category, in order to solve the pretext tasks.","We often do not care about the performance of these pretext tasks, but rather how useful the learned features are for downstream tasks (classification, detection, segmentation)."],"pictures":0,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":73,"kind":"roadmap","title":"从重建任务回看表示学习","caption":"代理任务与下游效果需要分别检验","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/73.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":74,"part":"ppt/slides/slide74.xml","text":["Traditional Self-supervised Learning","Summary","Problems: ","Coming up with individual pretext tasks is tedious.","The learned representations may not be general.","image completion","rotation prediction","“jigsaw puzzle”","colorization"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":74,"kind":"roadmap","title":"从重建任务回看表示学习","caption":"代理任务与下游效果需要分别检验","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/74.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":75,"part":"ppt/slides/slide75.xml","text":["Contents","Introduction","Traditional SSL","Modern SSL","        Contrastive learning: SimCLR, MOCO","        Self-Distillation without labels: DINO"],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":75,"kind":"roadmap","title":"现代自监督学习","caption":"围绕多视图之间的关系组织学习","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/75.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":76,"part":"ppt/slides/slide76.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A more general pretext task?","same object"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":76,"kind":"roadmap","title":"现代自监督学习","caption":"围绕多视图之间的关系组织学习","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/76.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":77,"part":"ppt/slides/slide77.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A more general pretext task?","same object","different object"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":77,"kind":"roadmap","title":"现代自监督学习","caption":"围绕多视图之间的关系组织学习","note":"","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/77.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":78,"part":"ppt/slides/slide78.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Contrastive Representation Learning"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":78,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/78.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":79,"part":"ppt/slides/slide79.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Contrastive Representation Learning"],"pictures":8,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":79,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/79.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":80,"part":"ppt/slides/slide80.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A formulation of contrastive learning","What we want: ","x: reference sample; x+ positive sample; x- negative sample","Given a chosen score function, we aim to learn an encoder function f that yields high score for positive pairs (x, x+) and low scores for negative pairs (x, x-)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":80,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/80.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":81,"part":"ppt/slides/slide81.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A formulation of contrastive learning","Loss function given 1 positive sample and N - 1 negative samples: "],"pictures":3,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":81,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/81.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":82,"part":"ppt/slides/slide82.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A formulation of contrastive learning","Loss function given 1 positive sample and N - 1 negative samples:","This seems familiar … ","score for the positive pair","score for the N-1 negative pairs"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":82,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/82.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":83,"part":"ppt/slides/slide83.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A formulation of contrastive learning","Loss function given 1 positive sample and N - 1 negative samples:","This seems familiar … ","Cross entropy loss for a N-way softmax classifier!","I.e., learn to find the positive sample from the N samples","score for the positive pair","score for the N-1 negative pairs"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":83,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/83.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":84,"part":"ppt/slides/slide84.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","A formulation of contrastive learning","Loss function given 1 positive sample and N - 1 negative samples:","Commonly known as the InfoNCE loss (van den Oord et al., 2018)","A lower bound on the mutual information between f(x) and f(x+)","The larger the negative sample size (N), the tighter the bound"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":84,"kind":"contrastive","title":"拉近相关视图，区分对照样本","caption":"同一样本的不同增强构成正样本关系","note":"点的位置为概念示意；增强定义了模型需要保持稳定的变化。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/84.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":85,"part":"ppt/slides/slide85.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR: A Simple Framework for Contrastive Learning"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":85,"kind":"simclr","title":"SimCLR 的两路计算","caption":"共享编码器与投影头，通过对比损失连接两种视图","note":"下游通常使用编码器表示；损失则作用于投影空间。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/85.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":86,"part":"ppt/slides/slide86.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR: A Simple Framework for Contrastive Learning","Cosine similarity as the score function:","Use a projection network g(·) to project features to a space where contrastive learning is applied","Generate positive samples through data augmentation: random cropping, random color distortion, and random blur."],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":86,"kind":"simclr","title":"SimCLR 的两路计算","caption":"共享编码器与投影头，通过对比损失连接两种视图","note":"下游通常使用编码器表示；损失则作用于投影空间。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/86.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":87,"part":"ppt/slides/slide87.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Data Augmentation"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":87,"kind":"augment","title":"数据增强决定正样本关系","caption":"裁剪、颜色扰动等变换形成不同视图","note":"比较裁剪、颜色扰动与模糊带来的变化，以及它们保留的信息。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/87.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image104.png","lesson":5,"page":87}]}},{"page":88,"part":"ppt/slides/slide88.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR","Generate a positive pair","by sampling data","augmentation functions"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":88,"kind":"simclr","title":"批次中的视图形成对比集合","caption":"增加批量可提供更多当前批次内的对照样本","note":"更大批量也会带来更多激活存储和计算成本。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/88.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":89,"part":"ppt/slides/slide89.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR","Generate a positive pair","by sampling data","augmentation functions","InfoNCE loss:","Use all non-positive","samples in the batch","as x-"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":89,"kind":"simclr","title":"批次中的视图形成对比集合","caption":"增加批量可提供更多当前批次内的对照样本","note":"更大批量也会带来更多激活存储和计算成本。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/89.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":90,"part":"ppt/slides/slide90.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR","Generate a positive pair","by sampling data","augmentation functions","InfoNCE loss:","Use all non-positive","samples in the batch","as x-","Iterate through and use each of the 2N sample as reference, compute average loss"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":90,"kind":"simclr","title":"批次中的视图形成对比集合","caption":"增加批量可提供更多当前批次内的对照样本","note":"更大批量也会带来更多激活存储和计算成本。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/90.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":91,"part":"ppt/slides/slide91.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR: mini-batch training","“Affinity matrix”","List of positive pairs","Each 2k and 2k+1 element is a positive pair"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":91,"kind":"simclr","title":"批次中的视图形成对比集合","caption":"增加批量可提供更多当前批次内的对照样本","note":"更大批量也会带来更多激活存储和计算成本。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/91.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":92,"part":"ppt/slides/slide92.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR: mini-batch training","= classification label for each row","“Affinity matrix”","List of positive pairs","Each 2k and 2k+1 element is a positive pair"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":92,"kind":"simclr","title":"批次中的视图形成对比集合","caption":"增加批量可提供更多当前批次内的对照样本","note":"更大批量也会带来更多激活存储和计算成本。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/92.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":93,"part":"ppt/slides/slide93.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Training linear classifier on SimCLR features","Train feature encoder on ImageNet (entire training set) using SimCLR.","Freeze feature encoder, train a linear classifier on top with labeled data."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":93,"kind":"evaluation","title":"评价预训练的 SimCLR 表示","caption":"冻结主干做线性评估，或用少量标签微调","note":"少量标签实验使用 ImageNet 标注数据的 1% / 10%。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/93.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":94,"part":"ppt/slides/slide94.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Semi-supervised learning on SimCLR features","Train feature encoder on ImageNet (entire training set) using SimCLR.","Finetune the encoder with 1% / 10% of labeled data on ImageNet."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":94,"kind":"evaluation","title":"评价预训练的 SimCLR 表示","caption":"冻结主干做线性评估，或用少量标签微调","note":"少量标签实验使用 ImageNet 标注数据的 1% / 10%。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/94.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":95,"part":"ppt/slides/slide95.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR design choices: projection head","Linear / non-linear projection heads improve representation learning.","A possible explanation:","Contrastive learning objective may discard useful information for downstream tasks.","Representation space z is trained to be invariant to data transformation.","By leveraging the projection head g(ᐧ), more information can be preserved in the h representation space."],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":95,"kind":"projection","title":"表示空间与对比空间的分工","caption":"投影头承接对比损失，编码器保留可迁移表示","note":"预训练目标使用的空间，不必等于下游最终使用的表示空间。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/95.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":96,"part":"ppt/slides/slide96.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","SimCLR design choices: large batch size","Large training batch size is crucial for SimCLR!","Large batch size causes large memory footprint during backpropagation: requires distributed training on TPUs"],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":96,"kind":"projection","title":"表示空间与对比空间的分工","caption":"投影头承接对比损失，编码器保留可迁移表示","note":"预训练目标使用的空间，不必等于下游最终使用的表示空间。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/96.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":97,"part":"ppt/slides/slide97.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Momentum Contrastive Learning (MoCo)","Key differences to SimCLR:","Keep a running queue of keys (negative samples).","Compute gradients and update the encoder only through the queries.","Decouple min-batch size with the number of keys: can support a large number of negative samples."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":97,"kind":"moco","title":"队列与动量编码器","caption":"扩大对照集合，同时让键表示相对平稳地变化","note":"队列保存过去的键，动量编码器由参数移动平均更新。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/97.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":98,"part":"ppt/slides/slide98.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","Momentum Contrastive Learning (MoCo)","Key differences to SimCLR:","Keep a running queue of keys (negative samples).","Compute gradients and update the encoder only through the queries.","Decouple min-batch size with the number of keys: can support a large number of negative samples.","The key encoder is slowly progressing through the momentum update rules:"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":98,"kind":"moco","title":"队列与动量编码器","caption":"扩大对照集合，同时让键表示相对平稳地变化","note":"队列保存过去的键，动量编码器由参数移动平均更新。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/98.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":99,"part":"ppt/slides/slide99.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","MoCo","Generate a positive pair","by sampling data","augmentation functions","No gradient through","the key","Update the FIFO negative sample queue","Use the running queue of keys as the negative samples","InfoNCE loss","Update f_k through momentum"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":99,"kind":"moco","title":"队列与动量编码器","caption":"扩大对照集合，同时让键表示相对平稳地变化","note":"队列保存过去的键，动量编码器由参数移动平均更新。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/99.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":100,"part":"ppt/slides/slide100.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","MoCo V2","A hybrid of ideas from SimCLR and MoCo:","From SimCLR: non-linear projection head and strong data augmentation.","From MoCo: momentum-updated queues that allow training on a large number of negative samples  (no TPU required!)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":100,"kind":"moco","title":"队列与动量编码器","caption":"扩大对照集合，同时让键表示相对平稳地变化","note":"队列保存过去的键，动量编码器由参数移动平均更新。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/100.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":101,"part":"ppt/slides/slide101.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","MoCo vs. SimCLR vs. MoCo V2","Key takeaways:","Non-linear projection head and strong data augmentation are crucial for contrastive learning."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":101,"kind":"evidence","title":"对比学习方法的组成与结果","caption":"比较增强、投影头、编码器更新及对照样本来源","note":"同时比较增强方式、编码器更新、对照集合与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/101.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image116.png","lesson":5,"page":101}]}},{"page":102,"part":"ppt/slides/slide102.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","MoCo vs. SimCLR vs. MoCo V2","Key takeaways:","Decoupling mini-batch size with negative sample size allows MoCo-V2 to outperform SimCLR with smaller batch size (256 vs. 8192)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":102,"kind":"evidence","title":"对比学习方法的组成与结果","caption":"比较增强、投影头、编码器更新及对照样本来源","note":"同时比较增强方式、编码器更新、对照集合与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/102.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image117.png","lesson":5,"page":102}]}},{"page":103,"part":"ppt/slides/slide103.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","MoCo vs. SimCLR vs. MoCo V2","Key takeaways:","Non-linear projection head and strong data augmentation are crucial for contrastive learning.","Decoupling mini-batch size with negative sample size allows MoCo-V2 to outperform SimCLR with smaller batch size (256 vs. 8192).","… all with much smaller memory footprint! (“end-to-end” means SimCLR here)"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":103,"kind":"evidence","title":"对比学习方法的组成与结果","caption":"比较增强、投影头、编码器更新及对照样本来源","note":"同时比较增强方式、编码器更新、对照集合与评价协议。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/103.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image118.png","lesson":5,"page":103}]}},{"page":104,"part":"ppt/slides/slide104.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO: Self-Distillation with No Labels"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":104,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/104.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":105,"part":"ppt/slides/slide105.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO","Input processing: ","Two random augmentations are performed on the same image to generate global views (large crops) and local views (local crops).","Global views: Large patches (typically occupying 50%-100% of the original image).","Local views: Small patches (typically occupying 20%-50% of the original image), multiple views are generated (e.g., 8)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":105,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/105.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":106,"part":"ppt/slides/slide106.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO","Teacher Model: Input only global view (large tile), output probability distribution.","Teacher output undergoes Centering + Sharpening processing.","Gradients are not calculated to avoid mode collapse.","Student Model: Input global view + local views (1 large image + 8 small images).","Predicted outputs are calculated for all views."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":106,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/106.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":107,"part":"ppt/slides/slide107.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO","Cross-entropy loss is used to measure the consistency between student and teacher predictions: ","For each view, the student output matches the teacher's output for the global view. ","The total loss is a weighted sum of the losses for all views (with a higher weight for the global view)."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":107,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/107.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":108,"part":"ppt/slides/slide108.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO","Centering: ","Maintaining a moving average (mean) of teacher outputs.","Subtracting this mean from each batch prevents any one dimension from dominating."],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":108,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/108.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":109,"part":"ppt/slides/slide109.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO","Sharpening:","Using a low temperature parameter τ_t < 1 makes the teacher output distribution sharper.","This forces the model to make more deterministic predictions, enhancing feature discrimination.","Students use a higher temperature τ_s > τ_t.: "],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":109,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/109.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":110,"part":"ppt/slides/slide110.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO","The combination of momentum encoder and centering effectively prevents pattern collapse.","No contrastive learning or negative samples are required."],"pictures":2,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":110,"kind":"dino","title":"无标签的教师—学生学习","caption":"不同视图的预测通过蒸馏目标保持一致","note":"教师参数采用移动平均；中心化与温度处理控制输出分布。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/110.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":111,"part":"ppt/slides/slide111.xml","text":["Modern Self-supervised Learning","DINO v2","Data: 10x larger + carefully selected deduplication","Model: ViT-Giant + hierarchical decoder","Training: Distillation target upgrade + longer LR schedule","Regulation: KoLeo + MSE patch, locking in high-quality geometry"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":111,"kind":"dino-v2","title":"扩展可迁移的视觉表示","caption":"数据、模型与训练设计共同影响表示质量","note":"表示质量需要通过下游任务检验，像素重建与语义表示不是同一个目标。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/111.svg","sourceElements":[{"url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/elements/5/image123.png","lesson":5,"page":111}]}},{"page":112,"part":"ppt/slides/slide112.xml","text":["Thanks","Welcome to join VisionXLab","yangxue.site"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":112,"kind":"closing","title":"课程结语","caption":"Self-supervised Learning","note":"感谢学习，欢迎了解 VisionXLab：yangxue.site。","url":"/model-foundations/diagrams/5/112.svg","sourceElements":[]}}],"topics":[{"start":1,"end":2,"title":"本讲路线：监督信号从哪里来","body":"先讨论自监督学习的动机与评价，再按传统代理任务、MAE、对比学习与自蒸馏的顺序展开。","lab":null,"kind":"divider","id":"topic-1","chapter":"动机与评价"},{"start":3,"end":9,"title":"视觉任务与可迁移表示","body":"分类、检测、分割等视觉任务的输出不同，但都依赖有效的图像表示。预训练希望让模型先学到可迁移的特征，再适配具体下游任务。\n\n从 ImageNet 和视觉任务出发，理解预训练与迁移学习。评价表示时，不仅看预训练任务是否做得好，还要看它能否帮助新的任务。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-3","chapter":"动机与评价"},{"start":10,"end":16,"title":"自监督学习的基本思路","body":"大量数据没有人工标注，但数据自身仍包含可构造的监督关系。自监督学习通过设计预测、重建或一致性任务，从这些关系中学习表示。\n\n代理任务提供训练信号，下游任务检验表示是否有用。设计代理任务时，要避免模型只利用无关的捷径完成任务，而没有学到可迁移的内容。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-10","chapter":"动机与评价"},{"start":17,"end":20,"title":"如何评价学到的表示","body":"线性评估冻结预训练主干，只训练一个线性分类器；微调允许更新更多甚至全部模型参数。两者回答的问题不同：前者更直接检验固定表示，后者检验适配后的任务表现。\n\n比较方法时，保持数据、主干结构、训练预算和评价协议尽可能一致。同时比较自监督学习与其他学习范式的监督信号。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-17","chapter":"动机与评价"},{"start":21,"end":21,"title":"传统代理任务与掩码重建","body":"从相对位置、拼图、旋转、着色与修复任务，过渡到 Masked Autoencoder。","lab":null,"kind":"divider","id":"topic-21","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":22,"end":25,"title":"预测图像块的相对位置","body":"从一张图像抽取局部块，让模型预测它们的相对位置。为了完成任务，表示需要包含一定的结构和语义信息。\n\n预训练任务、近邻检索和检测结果提供了不同的评价视角。代理任务的准确率与下游表示质量相关，但并非同一个评价目标。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-22","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":26,"end":29,"title":"拼图任务：理解局部与整体","body":"把图像切成若干块并打乱顺序，模型需要识别或恢复排列关系。任务利用图像的空间结构构造监督，而不要求人工类别标签。\n\n观察不同排列及其训练流程。思考模型可能使用哪些线索：物体布局有助于学习语义，边缘接缝等线索也可能构成捷径。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-26","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":30,"end":35,"title":"旋转预测：从变换中构造标签","body":"对图像施加已知旋转，并预测旋转类别，就能从输入变换自动生成训练标签。模型可能需要理解物体通常的方向和结构。\n\n从任务构造、模型设计与下游效果三个方面理解旋转预测。这里的变换不是任意越多越好，应考虑它能否形成有意义且可迁移的学习信号。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-30","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":36,"end":44,"title":"图像着色：由灰度预测颜色","body":"着色任务根据图像的灰度或亮度信息预测颜色。完成任务可能需要识别物体和场景，但同一个灰度输入也可能存在多种合理颜色。\n\n区分输入中保留了哪些信息、模型预测的是哪种颜色表示，以及训练目标怎样处理不确定性。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-36","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":45,"end":54,"title":"视频着色与跨帧对应","body":"视频把单帧任务扩展到时间维度。着色和信息传播要求模型利用不同帧之间的对应关系，才能把局部颜色或表示传到合适位置。\n\n观察目标如何跨帧移动，以及遮挡、外观变化和相似区域会怎样影响对应。时间上的一致性为表示学习提供了另一种信号。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-45","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":55,"end":59,"title":"图像修复：从可见内容预测缺失区域","body":"遮住图像的一部分，再要求模型重建缺失内容，就能用原图本身构造监督目标。模型需要结合可见上下文推断局部结构。\n\n遮挡方式和重建目标影响模型学到的信息。像素重建质量与语义表示质量并不完全相同，需要结合下游评价判断。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-55","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":60,"end":65,"title":"MAE：高遮挡比例与非对称结构","body":"MAE 将图像划分为 patch，随机遮挡其中较大一部分，编码器只处理可见 patch。较轻的解码器结合可见表示与 mask token，重建缺失区域。\n\n这种非对称设计把较重的编码计算集中在可见输入上。流程依次包含遮挡、编码、补入 mask token 和重建；下方遮挡实验帮助观察输入信息量的变化。","lab":"masking","kind":"lesson","id":"topic-60","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":66,"end":74,"title":"理解 MAE 的评价与重建结果","body":"结合线性评估、微调、配置消融、方法比较和重建案例，检验表示质量。重建图可直观显示模型利用了哪些上下文。\n\n评估时仍需区分“生成合理像素”和“形成适合下游任务的表示”。保留相同评价协议，才能判断某项设计是否改善了目标能力。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-66","chapter":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":75,"end":77,"title":"现代自监督学习","body":"从代理任务转向不同视图之间的表示关系，学习对比目标、动量编码器与无标签自蒸馏。","lab":null,"kind":"divider","id":"topic-75","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":78,"end":84,"title":"对比学习：拉近相关视图","body":"从同一样本生成的不同增强视图通常组成正样本对，其他样本提供对照。模型学习让相关视图的表示更接近，同时区分不相关的表示。\n\n对比目标中，温度控制相似度分布的尺度。增强方式定义了模型应对哪些变化保持稳定，因此它也是学习目标的一部分。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-78","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":85,"end":90,"title":"SimCLR 的完整训练路径","body":"同一图像经过两次随机增强，分别通过共享编码器和投影头，再在投影空间计算对比损失。先理解两路计算框架，再比较不同数据增强如何定义正样本关系。\n\n编码器输出与投影头输出承担不同角色：预训练的损失计算空间，不一定就是下游任务最终使用的表示空间。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-85","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":91,"end":96,"title":"批量大小、投影头与下游评价","body":"SimCLR 的批次同时提供许多对照样本，批量大小会影响负样本集合与优化。投影头则改变了对比目标作用的空间。\n\n从大批量训练、线性评估、半监督结果和消融实验几个角度比较方法。比较时同时记录预训练设置和下游协议，避免把不同条件下的结果直接并列。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-91","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":97,"end":103,"title":"MoCo：队列与动量编码器","body":"MoCo 使用队列保存一组键表示，并用动量更新的编码器计算键，使较大的对照集合不必完全依赖当前批次。\n\n动量更新可写为 $\\theta_k\\leftarrow m\\theta_k+(1-m)\\theta_q$。进一步考察 MoCo v2，并比较实例级方法的组成：增强、编码器更新、负样本来源与损失。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-97","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":104,"end":110,"title":"DINO：无标签的教师—学生学习","body":"DINO 让学生对不同图像视图的预测与教师输出保持一致。教师参数通过学生参数的移动平均更新；全局与局部视图构成多尺度训练信号。\n\n视图构造、教师与学生、交叉熵、中心化与锐化共同组成训练流程。中心化和温度控制输出分布，配合动量教师缓解退化解；训练不依赖显式负样本对。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-104","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":111,"end":111,"title":"DINOv2：继续扩展可迁移视觉表示","body":"DINOv2 进一步展示了更大规模、经过处理的数据与训练设计对表示质量的作用。\n\n回顾各方法时，可以沿四个问题比较：监督关系如何构造、模型哪些部分被更新、怎样避免无信息的表示、最终使用什么下游协议评价。","lab":null,"kind":"lesson","id":"topic-111","chapter":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":112,"end":112,"title":"课程结语","body":"本讲内容到此结束。感谢学习 Self-supervised Learning，欢迎了解 VisionXLab：yangxue.site。","lab":null,"kind":"divider","id":"topic-112","chapter":"结语"}],"chapters":[{"start":1,"title":"动机与评价"},{"start":21,"title":"传统代理任务与 MAE"},{"start":75,"title":"现代自监督学习"},{"start":112,"title":"结语"}]}}]}]
